    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subsessa</span></b> , ae, f.
		subsido, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an ambush</i>, <i>ambuscade</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subsessas occultius collocare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 3, 6 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in subsessā esse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 22</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostium dolos subsessas vocamus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. A. 11, 268</span></i>
			.</div>
